---

---

<section class="py-24 sm:py-32 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-black via-slate-950/30 to-black"></div>

  <div class="relative max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="text-center mb-16 animate-on-scroll">
      <p class="text-brand-400 text-sm font-medium tracking-wider uppercase mb-3">See It In Action</p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">An AI That Actually Speaks ICT</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Not a generic chatbot. NeuroSpect Mentor understands Fair Value Gaps, Order Blocks, Market Structure Shifts, and every ICT concept your mentor taught you.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6 items-start">
      <!-- Chat mockup -->
      <div class="animate-on-scroll rounded-2xl neon-card-cyan neon-card overflow-hidden">
        <div class="px-4 py-3 border-b border-white/[0.06] flex items-center gap-2">
          <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-red-500/60"></div>
          <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-yellow-500/60"></div>
          <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-green-500/60"></div>
          <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 ml-2 font-mono">NeuroSpect Mentor</span>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 space-y-4 font-mono text-sm">
          <div class="flex justify-end">
            <div class="max-w-[80%] px-4 py-2.5 rounded-2xl rounded-br-sm bg-brand-600/20 border border-brand-500/20 text-slate-200">
              I entered short on ES at a FVG but price swept my stop. What did I miss?
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex justify-start">
            <div class="max-w-[90%] px-4 py-3 rounded-2xl rounded-bl-sm bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/[0.06] text-slate-300 space-y-2">
              <p>Looking at your entry, there are two issues from the <span class="text-brand-400">Silver Bullet Entry Model</span>:</p>
              <p class="text-slate-400">1. The FVG you targeted was <span class="text-amber-400">unmitigated but inside a prior breaker</span> &mdash; this creates a conflict zone where price is likely to sweep.</p>
              <p class="text-slate-400">2. Your stop was placed at the FVG high, but the model specifies stops above the <span class="text-brand-400">last swing high before displacement</span>.</p>
              <div class="pt-2 border-t border-white/[0.06]">
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-600">Sources: <span class="text-brand-500/60">Silver Bullet Entry Model</span> &middot; <span class="text-brand-500/60">FVG Classification Rules</span> &middot; <span class="text-brand-500/60">Your Trade #247</span></p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex justify-start">
            <div class="max-w-[90%] px-4 py-3 rounded-2xl rounded-bl-sm bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/[0.06]">
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Entry Model Checklist</p>
              <div class="space-y-1.5 text-sm">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-400">&#10003;</span><span class="text-slate-400">Time window (10:00-11:00 ET)</span></div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-400">&#10003;</span><span class="text-slate-400">Displacement present</span></div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-400">&#10003;</span><span class="text-slate-400">FVG identified</span></div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-red-400">&#10007;</span><span class="text-slate-400">No conflicting PD array</span></div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-red-400">&#10007;</span><span class="text-slate-400">Stop above swing high</span></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Value props alongside -->
      <div class="space-y-4 stagger-children">
        <div class="animate-on-scroll rounded-2xl neon-card p-5">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-brand-500/10 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white mb-1">Source-Grounded Citations</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Every answer cites the specific ICT concept, entry model, or course module it came from. No hallucinations.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="animate-on-scroll rounded-2xl neon-card p-5">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-purple-500/10 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-purple-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white mb-1">Entry Model Checklists</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Deterministic validation against all 7 machine-readable entry models. Pass/fail on every criterion.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="animate-on-scroll rounded-2xl neon-card p-5">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/10 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-amber-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white mb-1">Personalized to Your Trading</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">The coach reads your journal. It knows your recurring mistakes, your best setups, and your risk profile.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="animate-on-scroll rounded-2xl neon-card p-5">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white mb-1">Available 24/7</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Pre-session prep, mid-session questions, post-session review. Your mentor sleeps. NeuroSpect doesn't.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
